,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.6 rc1\n4.5.1 stable\n4.0.4 stable\n3.6.2 stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.rc1 - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 3 monitors - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 9060 XT (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 32.0.22029.9039) - AMD Ryzen 7 9700X 8-Core Processor (16 threads) - 31.10 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn Godot 4, the Google IME popup does not appear.\nThis is a display-only issue; you can still input normally with Google IME.\nThis issue seems to be specific to Google IME, as the Microsoft IME popup displays correctly.\n\nMicrosoft IME:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7cb458a3-0450-46ca-bc64-8b47022d6af3)\n\nGoogle IME:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/20695edc-a814-4fee-aed4-e5c846a01cf0)\n\nAll the 4.x versions I've checked have same problem, but in version 3.6.2, the popup appears.\n\nI found that the same problem in other issue (#109946), but a topic of this issue is not about popups, I report it a as new issue.\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nInput text with Google IME on Godot Editor.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/rep